WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.215 --> 00:00:04.688
Good hand washing technique.

00:00:05.545 --> 00:00:08.065
Could be a surgeon, I don't know yet.

00:00:08.065 --> 00:00:10.238
Oh (glass shattering) Oh, Oh.

00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:15.104
- Help, Help.
- Adam.

00:00:15.104 --> 00:00:15.937
Oh my God.

00:00:17.796 --> 00:00:19.463
- Somebody call 911.

00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:22.845
- Well calling for help
is the right thing.

00:00:22.845 --> 00:00:24.015
That's the first thing you want to do

00:00:24.015 --> 00:00:25.465
in these types of situations.

00:00:27.645 --> 00:00:28.715
- His jugular vein's been cut.

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:29.585
Does anyone have a clean cloth?

00:00:29.585 --> 00:00:31.232
