the jugular vein that's...

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:32.065
- I have a fresh one in my bag

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.062
- Pretty impressive.
- That's great.

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:44.545
Putting pressure on a wound
like this is the first thing

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:47.015
you need to do outside of
obviously calling for help.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:48.765
Anything you can do to stop the bleeding,

00:00:48.765 --> 00:00:51.595
put pressure on the side, is
important in order to help

00:00:51.595 --> 00:00:52.805
that person survive.

00:00:52.805 --> 00:00:53.855
- You're killing him.

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:56.788
- I'm saving his life he was bleeding out.

00:00:56.788 --> 00:00:58.985
