00:00:58.985 --> 00:01:00.885
- I think I remember enough of Anatomy 101

00:01:00.885 --> 00:01:01.782
to know where the jugular vein is.

00:01:01.782 --> 00:01:04.455
- You would be in the right
place if he were an adult.

00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:06.315
He's not an adult. He is a boy.

00:01:06.315 --> 00:01:08.895
Which means you're also
putting pressure on his trachea

00:01:08.895 --> 00:01:10.945
which means he's not currently breathing.

00:01:13.035 --> 00:01:14.495
- I can't really see where his hands are

00:01:14.495 --> 00:01:16.454
but it's good advice.

00:01:16.454 --> 00:01:19.703
(dramatic music)

00:01:19.703 --> 00:01:22.786
(boy deeply inhales)

00:01:30.385 --> 00:01:31.745
- Don't take it out.

00:01:31.745 --> 00:01:33.175
- Some glass.
- Don't take it out.

00:01:33.175 --> 00:01:34.105
- He'll be fine.

00:01:34.105 --> 00:01:34.945
- Yeah.

00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:35.778
- Who are you?

00:01:36.615 --> 00:01:38.825
- Hello, I'm doctor Shaun Murphy.

00:01:38.825 --> 00:01:42.155
I'm a surgical resident at San
Jose St. Bonaventure Hospital

00:01:42.155 --> 00:01:44.615
- Well hello doctor
Shaun. Nice to meet you.

00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:45.775
By the way just so you know

00:01:45.775 --> 00:01:48.155
if you have an object inserted into you.

00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:49.915
Object, I know that sounds kind of weird.

00:01:49.915 --> 00:01:51.245
If you get stabbed with a knife,

00:01:51.245 --> 00:01:52.685
some glass goes inside of you,

00:01:52.685 --> 00:01:53.538
if a nail goes inside of you.

00:01:53.538 --> 00:01:55.945
Never pull it out.

00:01:55.945 --> 00:01:57.685
Make sure you call 911,

00:01:57.685 --> 00:01:59.755
let the paramedics decide what to do.

00:01:59.755 --> 00:02:01.685
Let them take you to the nearest hospital.

00:02:01.685 --> 00:02:04.165
Because a lot of times
what that object is doing

00:02:04.165 --> 00:02:06.235
is preventing you from bleeding out

00:02:06.235 --> 00:02:08.095
'cause it's putting pressure on the spot

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:09.965
where the artery or vein was cut.

00:02:09.965 --> 00:02:12.265
- A special meeting of
the board of directors

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:14.425
as much as I love you all.

00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:16.955
