00:07:24.765 --> 00:07:26.915
'cause you want to stay
in the mid-axil area line.

00:07:26.915 --> 00:07:28.555
Meaning in the middle of your armpit.

00:07:28.555 --> 00:07:30.365
That way you have a lower
probability of hitting

00:07:30.365 --> 00:07:32.035
