body language recognition

00:08:41.755 --> 00:08:43.765
but they do so because
they're trained to do so.

00:08:43.765 --> 00:08:45.805
To make conversation seem more normal.

00:08:45.805 --> 00:08:48.235
Early intervention has showed
some very promising results

00:08:48.235 --> 00:08:49.645
